{"name":"Hello Dolly","slug":"hello-dolly","version":"1.7.2","author":"<a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/matt\/\">Matt Mullenweg<\/a>","author_profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/matt\/","contributors":{"matt":{"profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/matt\/","avatar":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/33252cd1f33526af53580fcb1736172f06e6716f32afdd1be19ec3096d15dea5?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g","display_name":"Matt Mullenweg"},"wordpressdotorg":{"profile":"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/wordpressdotorg\/","avatar":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g","display_name":"WordPress.org"}},"requires":"4.6","tested":"6.9.4","requires_php":false,"requires_plugins":[],"rating":88,"ratings":{"5":136,"4":13,"3":5,"2":8,"1":14},"num_ratings":176,"support_url":"https:\/\/wordpress.org\/support\/plugin\/hello-dolly\/","support_threads":0,"support_threads_resolved":0,"active_installs":600000,"last_updated":"2025-10-24 4:13am GMT","added":"2008-07-06","homepage":"http:\/\/wordpress.org\/plugins\/hello-dolly\/","sections":{"description":"<p>This is not just a plugin, it symbolizes the hope and enthusiasm of an entire generation summed up in two words sung most famously by Louis Armstrong: Hello, Dolly. When activated you will randomly see a lyric from Hello, Dolly in the upper right of your admin screen on every page.<\/p>\n<p>Thanks to Sanjib Ahmad for the artwork.<\/p>\n","reviews":"<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">A tribute to the plugin that started it all<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/mikelane\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/12b344431ce56cd51aaf1e930aa73adae153106bbd66b1a9ad1adb1483c45581?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/12b344431ce56cd51aaf1e930aa73adae153106bbd66b1a9ad1adb1483c45581?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/mikelane\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">mikelane<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">February 11, 2026<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This standalone PHP script delivers the classic Hello Dolly lyrics.<br \/>It\u2019s the classic Hello Dolly, one file, no plugin, pure tribute to the legend.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:code -->\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>\n&amp;lt;?php\n\/**\n * Hello Dolly - Minimalist Standalone with Fade-in\n *\/\n\nfunction hello_dolly_get_lyric() {\n    $lyrics = \"Hello, Dolly\nWell, hello, Dolly\nIt's so nice to have you back where you belong\nYou're lookin' swell, Dolly\nI can tell, Dolly\nYou're still glowin', you're still crowin'\nYou're still goin' strong\nWe feel the room swayin'\nWhile the band's playin'\nOne of your old favourite songs from way back when\nSo, take her wrap, fellas\nFind her an empty lap, fella\nDolly'll never go away again\nHello, Dolly\nWell, hello, Dolly\nIt's so nice to have you back where you belong\nYou're lookin' swell, Dolly\nI can tell, Dolly\nYou're still glowin', you're still crowin'\nYou're still goin' strong\nWe feel the room swayin'\nWhile the band's playin'\nOne of your old favourite songs from way back when\nGolly, gee, fellas\nFind her a vacant knee, fellas\nDolly'll never go away\nDolly'll never go away\nDolly'll never go away again\";\n\n    $lyrics = explode(\"\\n\", $lyrics);\n    return htmlspecialchars(trim($lyrics&#091;mt_rand(0, count($lyrics) - 1)]));\n}\n\n$chosen = hello_dolly_get_lyric();\n?&amp;gt;\n&amp;lt;!DOCTYPE html&amp;gt;\n&amp;lt;html lang=\"en\"&amp;gt;\n&amp;lt;head&amp;gt;\n    &amp;lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&amp;gt;\n    &amp;lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&amp;gt;\n    &amp;lt;title&amp;gt;Hello Dolly&amp;lt;\/title&amp;gt;\n    &amp;lt;style&amp;gt;\n        body {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            height: 100vh;\n            margin: 0;\n            background-color: #fafafa;\n            font-family: serif;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n        #dolly {\n            font-size: 2rem;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            opacity: 0;\n            animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in forwards;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fadeIn {\n            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n        }\n\n        .refresh-hint {\n            position: fixed;\n            bottom: 20px;\n            font-family: sans-serif;\n            font-size: 0.8rem;\n            color: #999;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n    &amp;lt;\/style&amp;gt;\n&amp;lt;\/head&amp;gt;\n&amp;lt;body&amp;gt;\n\n    &amp;lt;div id=\"dolly\"&amp;gt;\n        &amp;lt;?php echo $chosen; ?&amp;gt;\n    &amp;lt;\/div&amp;gt;\n\n    &amp;lt;a href=\"?\" class=\"refresh-hint\"&amp;gt;Refresh for more lyrics&amp;lt;\/a&amp;gt;\n\n&amp;lt;\/body&amp;gt;\n&amp;lt;\/html&amp;gt;\n<\/code><\/pre>\n<!-- \/wp:code --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">A Classic Piece of WordPress History<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/shadowheezy\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/c585e659ec4be268be7babb4979b5c25a726a68bf8a92ba39300a61bfb4375b9?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/c585e659ec4be268be7babb4979b5c25a726a68bf8a92ba39300a61bfb4375b9?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/shadowheezy\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">shadowheezy<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">October 21, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hello Dolly might be simple, but it\u2019s iconic. Every time I open my WordPress dashboard and see a lyric from Louis Armstrong\u2019s \u201cHello, Dolly!\u201d it\u2019s a small reminder of WordPress\u2019s roots \u2014 creativity, simplicity, and a touch of joy.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It doesn\u2019t do much, and that\u2019s the beauty of it. It\u2019s a little piece of nostalgia that connects every WordPress user to the spirit of open-source community and fun. Thanks for keeping this classic alive!<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">\u201cEasy to install, worked perfectly. Helped me learn WordPress plugin structur<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/manideep42\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/811fc71a630aad20e4f71307c7d21a1ef6ab8a019af98124aa620c1879c2c08c?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/811fc71a630aad20e4f71307c7d21a1ef6ab8a019af98124aa620c1879c2c08c?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/manideep42\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">manideep makkina <small>(manideep42)<\/small><\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">July 22, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\u201cEasy to install, worked perfectly. Helped me learn WordPress plugin structure<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Re-added this plugin<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/tapsuccess\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/12104b2fcea48203f81b208578cb845b352f546e10d6e04461e51e4656702ee2?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/12104b2fcea48203f81b208578cb845b352f546e10d6e04461e51e4656702ee2?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/tapsuccess\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">TapSuccess <small>(tapsuccess)<\/small><\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">May 13, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the past, I have deleted this plugin. Now I am learning how to make plugins.... I like it! Thanks, Matt<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">Nice Biolerplate code plugin<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/dimkiriakos\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/6da6f89369a1f097aa8203709258756c3c345d6c475172cf2ec656e7e4d7390d?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/6da6f89369a1f097aa8203709258756c3c345d6c475172cf2ec656e7e4d7390d?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/dimkiriakos\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">dimkiriakos<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">August 18, 2024<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even many people give a lot of hate to this plugin, they should not! This plugin is not something that it's useful your site operations, but it's a nice boilerplate for people that they want to start building plugins for WordPress. It shows that you don't need to write so much code to customize something in your WordPress app. It introduces the wptexturize function the get_user_locale, the admin_notices action hook and the admin_head action hook too. Yes it's not the mode elegant thing that comes. But it can be educational for beginners <\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">My site was hacked. Found this was added<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/foreverozone\/\"><img alt='' src='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/fb8077d5aa053789a796da1631cfa9d0ddde65aca409fa262cead2a2d3a9a2c7?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g' srcset='https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/fb8077d5aa053789a796da1631cfa9d0ddde65aca409fa262cead2a2d3a9a2c7?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-16 photo' height='16' width='16' loading='lazy' decoding='async'\/><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/profiles.wordpress.org\/foreverozone\/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">foreverozone<\/a> on <span class=\"review-date\">October 12, 2025<\/span>\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>My WP account was hacked. Deleted. Found this was added to my website.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not funny to me.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n\t<div class=\"review-head\">\n\t\t<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"review-title\">what a wonderful world!<\/h4>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"star-rating\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"><\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"reviewer\">\n\t\t\t\tBy <a href=\"https:\/\/profi